    "abbreviations": "AC - As-cast condition\nT6 - Solution heat treated and artificially aged\nPM - Permanent mould cast\nRp0.2 - Yield strength at 0.2% offset\nUTS - Ultimate tensile strength\nA% - Percentage elongation\nbal. - Balance (remainder is aluminum)",
